{"quest_id": 8332, "name": "タカマガハラの神々", "description": "天の岩戸に突入する王子一行の行く手を\nさえぎる様に魑魅魍魎が姿を現す……。\n迫りくる敵を打ち払え！\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "event": "天墜の神と天翔の船", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920219, "map_no": 4929, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1400, "attack": 460, "base_hp": 1400, "base_attack": 460, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2099312, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 101, "global_id": 100, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 360, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 360, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 80, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 2400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2111632, "race_id": 11, "special_effect_id": 233, "master_id": 30613, "global_id": 4232, "spawn_sec": 26}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["ステルス"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 77, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2126240, "change_to": 3, "change_condition": 1, "master_id": 33277, "global_id": 6894, "variants": [{"tags": ["ステルス"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 77, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2113920, "master_id": 30917, "global_id": 4536}], "spawn_sec": 78}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["ステルス"], "hp": 2500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 77, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097856, "master_id": 152, "global_id": 151, "spawn_sec": 82}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 16, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099440, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 84, "global_id": 83, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 90}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 2, "hp": 18000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 18000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 60, "attack_range": 30, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 90, "attack_interval": 234, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.7999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2149152, "race_id": 4, "special_effect_id": 72, "change_to": 7, "change_condition": 5, "missile_id": 275, "missile": {"speed": 7.0}, "master_id": 37806, "global_id": 11423, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 5, "to_global_id": 11424, "spawn_sec": 110}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 18000, "attack": 800, "base_hp": 18000, "base_attack": 800, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 60, "attack_range": 30, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 90, "attack_interval": 234, "move_speed": 1200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.7999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2149168, "race_id": 4, "special_effect_id": 72, "missile_id": 275, "missile": {"speed": 7.0}, "master_id": 37807, "global_id": 11424, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 5}], "popups": ["アンデッド系から\n攻撃を複数回受けると、\n麻痺状態になります。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "エピウス", "text": "……これが、天の岩戸の中？", "face": "u2194a1"}, {"name": "レクテ", "text": "もっと、明るくて優しい場所だと思ってたけど……。\nまるで洞窟の中みたいだね。", "face": "u2047a1"}, {"name": "ヒミコ", "text": "この風景は、おそらくまやかしね。\n本当はもっと違う見た目の場所なのだと思うわ。", "face": "u1950a1"}, {"name": "イヨ", "text": "ここに隠れた太陽の女神さまが、\n「外に陽光出さないようにしよー」って考えたら、\n本当に影響を遮断できちゃう、異世界みたいなものだね。", "face": "u1948a1"}, {"name": "シズカ", "text": "……タカマガハラの神さまは、\nほぼすべて、天の岩戸にこもっているのよね？", "face": "u101"}, {"name": "イヨ", "text": "うん、そうだよ。\n天墜神星さまや、\n祓剣主神さまのような例外もありうるけど。", "face": "u1948a1"}, {"name": "シズカ", "text": "なら、どうして今も、\n東の国には陽光が降り注いでいるの？", "face": "u101"}, {"name": "祓剣主神", "text": "人類に世界を譲ってなお、\n陽光がないと困るだろうからって\n少しだけ手を貸してるんだよ、あの女神は。", "face": "u2154a1"}, {"name": "祓剣主神", "text": "他のオリュンポスと縁深い地域だって、\nきっと似たようなものだと思うよ？", "face": "u2154a1"}, {"name": "シズカ", "text": "…………なるほど。", "face": "u101"}, {"name": "ヨシノ", "text": "（……嬉しそうだね？）", "face": "u1104a1"}, {"name": "シズカ", "text": "（当然よ。だって、見捨てられたんじゃなくて、\n見守ってくれているってことだもの）", "face": "u101"}, {"name": "ユリクセス", "text": "まっ、その見守ってくれてる神さまのところに、\n僕らはこれから乗り込んでいくわけだ。", "face": "u2193a1"}, {"name": "ユリクセス", "text": "諸君、戦闘準備だ。\nアメノタヂカラが言っていたとおり、\nここから先は無理やり押し通る必要がある。", "face": "u2193a1"}, {"name": "アキレア", "text": "つまり、敵を蹴散らして進めってことだな。\nそういうのは分かりやすいぜ！", "face": "u1972a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アキレア", "text": "……何か変だな、殴ってる気がしないっていうか。", "face": "u1972a1"}, {"name": "イヨ", "text": "この風景と同じく、\n襲ってくる魑魅魍魎もまやかしなんだろうね。", "face": "u1948a1"}, {"name": "ヒミコ", "text": "移ろう幻影、様々な姿を取るこれらのまやかし。\nおそらく私たちの\n相手をしてくれているのは、ツクヨミさまだと思うわ。", "face": "u1950a1"}, {"name": "アラン", "text": "ああ、確かに。\nこの術の扱い方には、見覚えがあります。", "face": "u1511a1"}, {"name": "キャリー", "text": "ツクヨミというのは、どんな神さまなんですか？", "face": "u2233a1"}, {"name": "アラン", "text": "そうですね……。\n強情で、気まぐれで、そこそこに博識で……。", "face": "u1511a1"}, {"name": "イヨ", "text": "とっても優しい神さまだよ！", "face": "u1948a1"}, {"name": "トラム", "text": "（月の神性を持つ子って、性質が似るのかしら？）", "face": "u1110a1"}, {"name": "アラン", "text": "姉さま？　なにか言いました？", "face": "u1511a1"}, {"name": "トラム", "text": "ふふふ。いいえ、何も♪", "face": "u1110a1"}, {"name": "ヒミコ", "text": "さて、そろそろこの洞窟も終わりよ。\n最深部――見せかけの終着点が、\nこの先に待っているはず。", "face": "u1950a1"}, {"name": "イヨ", "text": "よし、ドスコーイの精神で！", "face": "u1948a1"}]}], "active": true}